# Classes Minecraft 26.3 moved out of Blaze3D into Renderpearl, the render API it split off into a
# library of its own, each under the same simple name. The shared sources are written against the
# 26.2 names on the left and a 26.3 build compiles them rewritten onto the right; see build.gradle.
#
# Generated by pairing every top-level class the 26.2 client jar has under com.mojang.blaze3d and the
# 26.3 one no longer has with the one class of the same simple name the 26.3 jar has under
# com.mojang.renderpearl. A class 26.3 removed outright is not here, and code naming one lives under
# src/mc26.2/ with its 26.3 counterpart under src/mc26.3/.

com.mojang.blaze3d.GpuDeviceLossException                       com.mojang.renderpearl.api.device.GpuDeviceLossException
com.mojang.blaze3d.GpuFormat                                    com.mojang.renderpearl.api.GpuFormat
